1
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:15,000
The Beijing Asian Games are coming soon

2
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:18,280
and we will bring warmth with our Panda Panpan thermos.

3
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:20,314
[Shang Quanliang staff of the Security Section of the thermos factory]
This time,

4
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:23,550
the Panda Panpan thermos we co-produce

5
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:27,870
will bring the passion and warmth

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,040
to every household.

7
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,790
Look how pretentious Shang Quanliang is.

8
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:32,310
He's even taking notes.

9
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:32,790
Wow.

10
00:00:32,790 --> 00:00:34,430
Our products will warm the Northeast

11
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:37,720
and the entire China.

12
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,840
[Celebration of Becoming the Licensed Thermos Manufacturer of the Asian Games and Safe Production Mobilization Meeting]
There will be a day

13
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,270
when our products are sold in Asia

14
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:44,200
and the entire world.

15
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:50,910
We shall prioritize

16
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:55,080
safety in production.

17
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,270
We shall not have accidents all year round.

18
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:01,270
[Can we forget the problems we have now by exploring alien civilizations?]
Safe production is the most important,

19
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:04,480
we have to remember that.

20
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:07,360
Do you think we can do it?

21
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,310
Yes!

22
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:26,340
[Good Guy Good Luck]

23
00:02:26,380 --> 00:02:29,300
[Episode 1]

24
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,630
Bean sprout, please.

25
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,550
Okay. Bean sprout.

26
00:02:36,030 --> 00:02:37,830
Chinese cabbage, please.

27
00:02:38,390 --> 00:02:39,190
Okay.

28
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:48,830
Hey.

29
00:02:49,270 --> 00:02:49,800
Quanliang.

30
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,190
Come and sit here.

31
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,520
Come on.

32
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,270
It's the same.

33
00:02:53,270 --> 00:02:53,830
Sit here.

34
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:59,960
[UFO Research]
I see that you paid a lot of attention to the meeting just now.

35
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,960
You were even taking notes.

36
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,830
You'll be the one who ensures

37
00:03:03,830 --> 00:03:05,720
our accident-free production in the future.

38
00:03:06,470 --> 00:03:08,000
Accident-free production all year round

39
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,270
is not difficult.

40
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:12,030
I had three accident-free years

41
00:03:12,110 --> 00:03:13,960
when I worked as a driver in the provincial capital.

42
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,360
How long did you work there?

43
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:17,520
Ten years.

44
00:03:18,630 --> 00:03:20,910
Then I'd rather call it

45
00:03:21,110 --> 00:03:22,830
seven years with accidents.

46
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:28,240
When there's no common ground, it's useless to talk.

47
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:29,550
I'm leaving.

48
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,360
Is this the Hospital of Liuhe County?

49
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:35,880
I want to speak to Dr. Shang Jin.

50
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:36,880
Wait a moment.

51
00:03:37,030 --> 00:03:37,880
I'll find her.

52
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,030
Thank you.

53
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:42,080
Hello.

54
00:03:44,030 --> 00:03:44,960
Jin,

55
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:46,750
this is dad.

56
00:03:48,830 --> 00:03:50,240
Um,

57
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,910
Sunday is coming.

58
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:53,440
Will you go home?

59
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,880
You haven't been home for several months.

60
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:57,470
[Shang Jin Doctor of the Hospital of Liuhe County]
What do you want to eat? I'll cook it for you.

61
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,240
I'll go home if there are no patients.

62
00:03:59,750 --> 00:04:00,360
Okay.

63
00:04:00,550 --> 00:04:02,750
Tell me before you come back then.

64
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:04,720
I'll pick you up at the bus station.

65
00:04:04,830 --> 00:04:06,360
You don't need to. I can return by myself.

66
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:07,750
Dr. Shang!

67
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:10,080
I'm busy. Goodbye.

68
00:04:10,110 --> 00:04:10,830
What do you want...

69
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:37,670
Leave it there.

70
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,760
If you like it, ask your parents for money to buy it.

71
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,880
Behave yourselves.

72
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:51,830
Get out of here!

73
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:55,600
[New Books]

74
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,670
The books wear out

75
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:58,640
because of these naughty kids.

76
00:04:58,950 --> 00:04:59,830
How can I sell them?

77
00:05:00,230 --> 00:05:01,160
Quanliang, don't you think so?

78
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,880
Stop! Police here!

79
00:05:08,100 --> 00:05:10,220
[Hu Ting Detective of the Criminal Police
of the Municipal Public Security Bureau]

80
00:05:31,790 --> 00:05:32,390
Stop!

81
00:05:41,550 --> 00:05:42,640
I came here to look for my sister

82
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,550
and I happened to see you showering.

83
00:05:45,270 --> 00:05:45,920
How dare you peep at me when I was showering?

84
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:46,510
Freeze!

85
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:53,550
Freeze! Police here!

86
00:05:54,790 --> 00:05:55,480
Stop!

87
00:05:56,230 --> 00:05:56,830
Freeze!

88
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:58,480
Stop!

89
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:07,350
Come down!

90
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:13,510
Dayu, come on.

91
00:06:46,790 --> 00:06:47,920
It aches all over.

92
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,440
Doctor,

93
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,440
hurry up. Give him an injection.

94
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:51,640
Now my father is the one who got injured.

95
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:53,640
Did you see him? He's old!

96
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:55,760
Now he's seriously injured,
who can take the responsibility?

97
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,720
Can you?

98
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,070
If you can't,

99
00:06:58,070 --> 00:07:00,040
find someone who can, okay?

100
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,390
Come on! Who can take the responsibility?

101
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:03,790
Did you see how serious my father's injury is?

102
00:07:03,830 --> 00:07:04,830
Listen,

103
00:07:04,830 --> 00:07:06,040
[Mr. Liu Chief of the Criminal Police of the Municipal Public Security Bureau]
drop the act!

104
00:07:15,270 --> 00:07:16,790
I just don't understand.

105
00:07:17,830 --> 00:07:20,160
You were just asked to catch a thief.
How did you mess it up?

106
00:07:23,830 --> 00:07:25,350
I'll see them and explain it then.

107
00:07:25,350 --> 00:07:27,040
You'd better not. Don't make it even harder.

108
00:07:27,670 --> 00:07:29,480
Go back and write a report now.

109
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:31,480
Every day you bring me new problems.

110
00:07:35,340 --> 00:07:37,380
[Xueqin's Dumplings]

111
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,550
Hello, Quanliang. You're off duty?

112
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:56,270
What kind of dumplings do you want?

113
00:07:56,270 --> 00:07:57,200
I'll make them for you now.

114
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:59,320
Mixed vegetable dumplings, your signature dish.

115
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,040
This one?

116
00:08:01,270 --> 00:08:02,070
Okay.

117
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:03,720
I'll peel the garlic.

118
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:07,160
[Xueqin Owner of the dumpling restaurant]
What stories are you reading?

119
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:08,510
Not stories,

120
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:10,200
but scientific knowledge.

121
00:08:10,830 --> 00:08:12,880
What scientific knowledge? Tell me about it.

122
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:15,000
Recently, there's big news

123
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,440
in the scientific community indeed.

124
00:08:17,270 --> 00:08:20,550
That is, the global human genome project

125
00:08:20,550 --> 00:08:22,000
has been launched.

126
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:24,110
What is genome?

127
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:28,830
Genome is something that decides

128
00:08:28,830 --> 00:08:30,950
human beings' health and character,

129
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:33,400
and it's invisible to the naked eye.

130
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,440
Its shape is like...

131
00:08:36,670 --> 00:08:38,200
A bit like this.

132
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:40,230
I'll show you.

133
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:45,110
It looks like...

134
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:48,760
Like this.

135
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,840
Fried dough twist?

136
00:08:50,590 --> 00:08:52,550
Xueqin, you're so smart.

137
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,230
I haven't thought of this

138
00:08:54,230 --> 00:08:55,280
after such a long time.

139
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:00,080
Dayu, what's up?

140
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:00,670
I'm okay.

141
00:09:01,790 --> 00:09:02,440
Dayu!

142
00:09:02,590 --> 00:09:03,280
I'm fine!

143
00:09:04,590 --> 00:09:05,760
You got into a fight again?

144
00:09:14,110 --> 00:09:14,910
Such

145
00:09:15,590 --> 00:09:16,280
a naughty boy.

146
00:09:17,150 --> 00:09:18,080
Teenage boys

147
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,320
are all like this. Forget about it.

148
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,470
He's my only younger brother.

149
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,000
I have to take care of him.

150
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:24,400
Quanliang,

151
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,150
you told me last time

152
00:09:26,150 --> 00:09:28,150
that the thermos factory might hire Dayu.

153
00:09:28,150 --> 00:09:29,280
How's that going?

154
00:09:30,110 --> 00:09:32,400
I... I've got a new idea.

155
00:09:32,550 --> 00:09:34,400
I'll tell you when there's progress.

156
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:36,910
Okay. Thank you.

157
00:09:37,030 --> 00:09:37,470
You're welcome.

158
00:09:37,470 --> 00:09:38,440
I'll cook the dumplings for you now.

159
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:38,840
Okay.

160
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,880
Mr. Hu, someone wants to see you.

161
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,030
Come in.

162
00:09:55,590 --> 00:09:56,280
Uncle.

163
00:09:57,230 --> 00:09:58,640
Why did you come late at night?

164
00:09:58,790 --> 00:09:59,550
Why did I come?

165
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:02,400
You work late every day. I'm here to bring you food.

166
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:03,840
You haven't had dinner, have you?

167
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:05,710
Here you are. Dumplings and liquor.

168
00:10:09,350 --> 00:10:10,640
Dumplings are fine,

169
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:11,910
but not liquor.

170
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:13,550
Let me see.

171
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,080
I happen to be hungry now.

172
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:16,470
Nice.

173
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:22,470
Um,

174
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,200
are you here

175
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,790
because you want me to help you?

176
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,110
Of course

177
00:10:29,590 --> 00:10:31,150
I'm here to visit you.

178
00:10:33,110 --> 00:10:35,590
I heard
that the public security bureau is recruiting.

179
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,280
Just temporary workers.

180
00:10:40,030 --> 00:10:41,550
Not permanent.

181
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,030
Is there an age requirement?

182
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:47,350
I think not. How old is that person?

183
00:10:47,470 --> 00:10:49,760
Born in 1938, in his early 50s.

184
00:10:50,910 --> 00:10:51,670
You?

185
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:52,350
Can I do it?

186
00:10:52,790 --> 00:10:53,550
What's up?

187
00:10:53,670 --> 00:10:55,550
You don't want to work
for the thermos factory anymore?

188
00:10:55,880 --> 00:10:57,350
Put in a good word for me please.

189
00:11:02,790 --> 00:11:03,670
Excuse me.

190
00:11:08,670 --> 00:11:09,470
Hello.

191
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:11,200
Hello, Ting.

192
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:12,520
I'm at the hospital.

193
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,200
They gave him an examination

194
00:11:14,470 --> 00:11:15,640
and there are no serious problems.

195
00:11:16,470 --> 00:11:17,520
He'll be discharged in two days.

196
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,440
Okay. Thank you.

197
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,320
See, the cap fits me.

198
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,590
It fits my head.

199
00:11:29,470 --> 00:11:30,840
What are you doing, uncle?

200
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:33,320
The police cap doesn't look good on a shaved head.

201
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:34,790
If I can work for the police,

202
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:36,110
I'll grow my hair

203
00:11:36,110 --> 00:11:37,760
just like yours, okay?

204
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:38,470
Take the cap off.

205
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:39,790
I promise.

206
00:11:39,790 --> 00:11:41,230
Take it off. Or others may see you

207
00:11:41,230 --> 00:11:42,400
and it will be

208
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:43,150
embarrassing.

209
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:48,710
What happened?

210
00:11:48,710 --> 00:11:50,550
It's okay. Something about work.

211
00:11:54,790 --> 00:11:56,230
You're on the night shift every day,

212
00:11:56,230 --> 00:11:57,910
and Ling is at home by herself. Is she okay?

213
00:11:58,790 --> 00:12:00,760
Yes. She's long got used to it.

214
00:12:01,230 --> 00:12:02,320
Got used to it.

215
00:12:03,670 --> 00:12:05,280
That's not a good thing.

216
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:07,030
Okay.

217
00:12:07,030 --> 00:12:08,400
How about you eat dumplings and stop talking?

218
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:09,880
Help yourself.

219
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:11,440
I bought them for you.

220
00:12:12,740 --> 00:12:17,300
[Crack Down on Crime to Maintain Public Order]

221
00:12:21,790 --> 00:12:23,440
Sir, I wonder if you could do me a favor.

222
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,710
My uncle...

223
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:25,520
Hu Ting,

224
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:26,880
I was going to talk to you.

225
00:12:27,030 --> 00:12:27,710
What's up?

226
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:31,200
The Director said the Register Office

227
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:33,110
is understaffed at the moment.

228
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,520
You can go help them

229
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:35,710
sort the documents.

230
00:12:36,710 --> 00:12:38,670
As for when you'll return,

231
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:40,470
let's wait and see.

232
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:43,230
What do you mean?

233
00:12:44,590 --> 00:12:46,030
Do you still remember

234
00:12:46,350 --> 00:12:47,230
that an old man was hospitalized because of you?

235
00:12:47,910 --> 00:12:49,760
But he's not seriously injured.

236
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:51,080
I don't know if he is,

237
00:12:51,150 --> 00:12:53,000
but his family is complaining

238
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:53,910
and asking you for compensation in the hospital.

239
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,550
I... I was trying to catch a thief, sir.

240
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:58,670
Where is the thief then?

241
00:12:59,030 --> 00:13:00,320
I was also trying to catch the person

242
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,710
who showed obscene videos.

243
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:03,230
So where are the videos?

244
00:13:03,710 --> 00:13:05,550
What...

245
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,670
Look.

246
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:09,320
You mistook a person for someone else last time.

247
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:10,910
That person ended up in hospital
and you had to offer compensation.

248
00:13:10,910 --> 00:13:12,440
It happened not so long ago, right?

249
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:14,030
Sir, it's been months.

250
00:13:14,590 --> 00:13:15,230
How can you be

251
00:13:15,230 --> 00:13:16,400
so stubborn?

252
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,200
Listen,

253
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,320
go to the hospital now

254
00:13:18,590 --> 00:13:20,320
and apologize to him earnestly.

255
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,470
This matter can only be settled

256
00:13:21,470 --> 00:13:22,760
when he forgives you.

257
00:13:23,110 --> 00:13:24,590
If you get into trouble again,

258
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,760
you'll be fired. Understand?

259
00:13:28,880 --> 00:13:29,550
Go now!

260
00:13:32,150 --> 00:13:32,670
Come back!

261
00:13:32,790 --> 00:13:34,030
What's up this time?

262
00:13:34,710 --> 00:13:36,230
You came to see me, didn't you?

263
00:13:36,230 --> 00:13:36,960
What's up?

264
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:37,640
Nothing!

265
00:13:39,230 --> 00:13:40,280
Go now!

266
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:42,200
Buy some gifts!

267
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:46,960
What's up, Ting?

268
00:13:47,590 --> 00:13:49,440
I got promoted.

269
00:13:55,670 --> 00:13:56,320
Is that bigger than yours?

270
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,030
Two kings.

271
00:13:57,550 --> 00:13:58,200
Follow or not?

272
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,280
I won.

273
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:01,350
I won. Two jokers.

274
00:14:01,350 --> 00:14:02,320
I won. No cards left.

275
00:14:02,670 --> 00:14:03,760
Give me money.

276
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:06,760
We're a family.

277
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:07,400
Are you giving me money?

278
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:08,550
- Son.
- We're a family...

279
00:14:08,550 --> 00:14:10,150
Give me money. You lost.

280
00:14:10,150 --> 00:14:10,960
So you're playing cards?

281
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:14,590
Why are you here?

282
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:17,640
Ask your boss to come.

283
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:19,000
We'll only talk to him.

284
00:14:19,550 --> 00:14:20,150
Right.

285
00:14:23,820 --> 00:14:27,100
[Crown Dance Hall]

286
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:31,640
Who?

287
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:34,760
An old man is hospitalized
because Hu Ting struck him?

288
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:35,520
Yeah.

289
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:37,550
How did you know that?

290
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:39,760
My neighbor Meng

291
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,150
works in the hospital.

292
00:14:41,590 --> 00:14:43,200
She knows everything there.

293
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,000
[Lyu Ling Shop assistant of the Department Store]
Then how serious

294
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,640
is

295
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:47,470
his injury?

296
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:51,640
He's fine.

297
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:54,590
He just wants to stay in hospital for longer

298
00:14:54,760 --> 00:14:55,760
so he can blackmail Hu Ting.

299
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:02,760
I mean, will Hu Ting be unhappy

300
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:04,000
when you return home late?

301
00:15:05,790 --> 00:15:07,150
He returns home even later than I do.

302
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,110
Really?

303
00:15:11,710 --> 00:15:13,030
I envy you.

304
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,840
I'll marry a policeman too.

305
00:15:16,790 --> 00:15:17,520
Min,

306
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:19,520
have you ever had feelings like this?

307
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:22,960
Nothing serious, but I just feel bored.

308
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:27,200
It's hard for me to breathe and I want to cry.

309
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:30,280
What's wrong?

310
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:33,280
Is everything okay between you and Hu Ting?

311
00:15:35,030 --> 00:15:35,670
Yes.

312
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:46,960
The next song is "Time to Wake Up"

313
00:15:47,110 --> 00:15:47,880
requested by Table No. 7.

314
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:48,400
It's your song.

315
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:49,280
Let's applaud.

316
00:16:07,420 --> 00:16:10,820
[Bian Diwu Owner of the Crown Dance Hall]

317
00:16:13,140 --> 00:16:16,020
[Zhao Changhai Subordinate of Bian Diwu]

318
00:16:34,500 --> 00:16:39,510
♪You said you've loved the wrong person♪

319
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:42,980
♪And you've been hurt♪

320
00:16:42,980 --> 00:16:46,760
♪You said you've made mistakes you should never make♪

321
00:16:46,890 --> 00:16:49,970
♪And you regretted it♪

322
00:16:50,050 --> 00:16:53,310
♪You said you've gone through all the difficulties♪

323
00:16:53,330 --> 00:16:56,580
♪And you didn't know who to trust♪

324
00:16:56,730 --> 00:16:59,990
♪You said you felt so upset♪

325
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:04,890
♪And you even questioned yourself♪

326
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:08,990
♪If you'd known that sadness was inevitable♪

327
00:17:09,030 --> 00:17:12,490
♪Maybe you wouldn't have been so devoted♪

328
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:15,980
♪Love is always unforgettable♪

329
00:17:16,060 --> 00:17:19,360
♪That little warmth is unnecessary♪

330
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:22,840
♪Sadness is always inevitable♪

331
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:26,450
♪It comes when you wake up♪

332
00:17:26,570 --> 00:17:29,950
♪There's something you don't have to ask now♪

333
00:17:30,020 --> 00:17:36,050
♪And there's someone you never have to wait for♪

334
00:17:50,470 --> 00:17:54,920
[Sunday]
Sunday comes.

335
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:58,880
Jin will come home today.

336
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:48,760
Doctor, help!

337
00:18:49,110 --> 00:18:50,110
Help!

338
00:18:50,190 --> 00:18:51,040
Doctor!

339
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:52,430
Help!

340
00:18:52,430 --> 00:18:53,880
Doctor, help!

341
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:55,160
Doctor!

342
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:56,680
Help!

343
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:57,470
- That's so scary.
- What's that?

344
00:18:57,470 --> 00:18:58,310
Help!

345
00:18:58,310 --> 00:18:59,000
That's horrifying.

346
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:00,230
Save him!

347
00:19:00,230 --> 00:19:01,400
What's wrong?

348
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:02,190
Please help.

349
00:19:02,190 --> 00:19:03,560
He went to Laoyao Mountain today

350
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:04,640
and returned like this.

351
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:05,680
And he has

352
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:07,430
all these strange things on his skin.

353
00:19:08,590 --> 00:19:09,560
Those lumps.

354
00:19:37,230 --> 00:19:37,950
Dr. Shang,

355
00:19:38,230 --> 00:19:39,040
the patient is twitching.

356
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,520
Blood oxygen level is dropping.

357
00:20:13,180 --> 00:20:15,220
[Telephone]

358
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:26,830
Can I speak to Dr. Shang, Shang Jin?

359
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,350
She has left.

360
00:20:29,070 --> 00:20:30,310
When did she leave?

361
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:31,950
She left in a hurry.

362
00:20:32,800 --> 00:20:35,110
She took the earliest bus to the provincial capital.

363
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:37,520
Why did she go to the provincial capital?

364
00:20:38,230 --> 00:20:39,310
I don't know that.

365
00:20:50,230 --> 00:20:51,430
Do you know Sun?

366
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:54,070
The bearded carpenter working in the tree farm.

367
00:20:55,520 --> 00:20:56,470
He likes to drink.

368
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:58,920
When he was drunk, he'd start a fight with his wife.

369
00:20:59,470 --> 00:21:01,560
Last year, he was fired

370
00:21:01,830 --> 00:21:03,190
and he began to drink even more.

371
00:21:03,310 --> 00:21:05,950
In the end, his wife left.

372
00:21:06,160 --> 00:21:07,350
She left with another guy?

373
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:10,640
When she left, she took all the money with her.

374
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:12,950
She only left ten yuan for their son.

375
00:21:13,470 --> 00:21:16,590
The women today are so cruel.

376
00:21:17,470 --> 00:21:18,950
When the marriage goes south, they will leave.

377
00:21:20,310 --> 00:21:22,280
I heard that the wife of Shang Quanliang,

378
00:21:22,920 --> 00:21:24,470
a security guard of our factory, has also left him.

379
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:26,590
Shang Quanliang?

380
00:21:26,950 --> 00:21:27,640
Yeah.

381
00:21:27,950 --> 00:21:30,560
Otherwise he wouldn't have left

382
00:21:30,560 --> 00:21:31,830
the provincial capital for Shuangyuhe.

383
00:21:32,400 --> 00:21:34,280
His wife cheated on him

384
00:21:34,950 --> 00:21:36,310
and everyone at his workplace knew it.

385
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:38,560
Quanliang felt so ashamed

386
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:41,070
that he came here with his daughter.

387
00:21:41,070 --> 00:21:42,950
I heard that he and his daughter are not close.

388
00:21:45,660 --> 00:21:49,060
[Eight years ago 1982 The provincial capital]

389
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:07,000
What are you doing?

390
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:09,830
Smoking?

391
00:22:09,950 --> 00:22:11,190
My mom won't spare you later.

392
00:22:13,070 --> 00:22:13,710
Mom.

393
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,040
Mom!

394
00:22:16,470 --> 00:22:17,070
Dad!

395
00:22:17,590 --> 00:22:18,520
Where is mom?

396
00:22:23,230 --> 00:22:25,310
Where is mom? I'm asking you.

397
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:30,590
I kicked her out.

398
00:22:49,470 --> 00:22:51,280
Hui, it's far,

399
00:22:51,280 --> 00:22:52,470
let's take turns driving.

400
00:22:52,470 --> 00:22:53,470
It's okay, sir.

401
00:22:53,470 --> 00:22:54,590
I can do it.

402
00:22:54,590 --> 00:22:55,400
Sir!

403
00:22:55,400 --> 00:22:56,830
Hurry up!

404
00:22:56,950 --> 00:22:59,350
A round trip to Shuangyuhe takes hours.

405
00:22:59,350 --> 00:22:59,920
Okay.

406
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:02,470
I drove the car here without telling anyone.

407
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:06,070
I have to return it to the factory before dawn.

408
00:23:07,230 --> 00:23:08,280
Where is Jin?

409
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:10,710
I'll find her.

410
00:23:11,430 --> 00:23:12,710
Why do I have to leave the big city

411
00:23:12,710 --> 00:23:14,350
for Shuangyuhe?

412
00:23:14,350 --> 00:23:15,950
You have to follow your father.

413
00:23:15,950 --> 00:23:16,470
Go.

414
00:23:17,470 --> 00:23:18,470
I won't!

415
00:23:18,950 --> 00:23:20,880
Why did you kick mom out?

416
00:23:21,280 --> 00:23:22,310
Get her back.

417
00:23:22,310 --> 00:23:23,400
I'll go if she goes.

418
00:23:24,070 --> 00:23:25,000
Stop the nonsense.

419
00:23:25,520 --> 00:23:26,800
Let's go.

420
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:44,640
Get mom back!

421
00:23:58,950 --> 00:24:00,190
You can't get it, can you?

422
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:04,160
Don't use chopsticks,

423
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:05,520
use your hand instead.

424
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:07,830
Just use your hand. Come on.

425
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:10,880
Ting.

426
00:24:14,160 --> 00:24:15,470
These years...

427
00:24:18,280 --> 00:24:18,950
These years are difficult for me.

428
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:22,880
What's wrong?

429
00:24:24,800 --> 00:24:26,000
I'm all alone.

430
00:24:27,280 --> 00:24:29,110
How?

431
00:24:29,590 --> 00:24:31,400
You still have me and Jin.

432
00:24:37,160 --> 00:24:38,950
Has Jin come home recently?

433
00:24:47,040 --> 00:24:48,230
In my opinion,

434
00:24:48,310 --> 00:24:50,310
you should tell Jin the truth.

435
00:24:50,640 --> 00:24:52,190
Her mother left home herself,

436
00:24:52,190 --> 00:24:53,680
you didn't kick her out.

437
00:24:55,830 --> 00:24:57,830
How can I tell her this?

438
00:24:57,830 --> 00:24:59,280
Why can't you?

439
00:25:00,110 --> 00:25:02,040
If her mother comes back in the future,

440
00:25:03,430 --> 00:25:05,160
how can they two face each other?

441
00:25:08,040 --> 00:25:09,430
I'll be the bad guy.

442
00:25:10,040 --> 00:25:12,070
Why do you have to be the bad guy?

443
00:25:12,350 --> 00:25:14,430
You're old now.

444
00:25:15,110 --> 00:25:16,350
You're not as strong as you think.

445
00:25:17,830 --> 00:25:18,680
I...

446
00:25:20,760 --> 00:25:21,590
Please...

447
00:25:23,830 --> 00:25:24,710
Please let me

448
00:25:24,710 --> 00:25:27,190
get the job in the public security bureau.

449
00:25:28,040 --> 00:25:29,470
So I can feel proud.

450
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:31,230
I'm begging you.

451
00:25:32,230 --> 00:25:33,350
Here's to you.

452
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:34,680
Please don't.

453
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:35,680
- Please don't.
- Here's to you.

454
00:25:35,880 --> 00:25:36,590
Please no.

455
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:37,710
Here's to you.

456
00:25:38,110 --> 00:25:38,800
Goodness me.

457
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:44,920
Uncle,

458
00:25:45,520 --> 00:25:46,760
I'll be honest.

459
00:25:47,710 --> 00:25:48,680
Recently

460
00:25:51,590 --> 00:25:53,310
I got into trouble too.

461
00:25:56,350 --> 00:25:57,520
Mind the steps.

462
00:25:59,710 --> 00:26:00,350
Take care.

463
00:26:00,710 --> 00:26:02,040
Take care on your way home.

464
00:26:02,040 --> 00:26:03,310
Be careful.

465
00:26:04,590 --> 00:26:06,950
What can I do to help you?

466
00:26:06,950 --> 00:26:08,590
You?

467
00:26:08,590 --> 00:26:09,590
You don't need to help.

468
00:26:09,880 --> 00:26:12,070
Just don't cause me trouble.

469
00:26:12,520 --> 00:26:13,520
Don't be angry.

470
00:26:14,070 --> 00:26:15,190
I won't.

471
00:26:18,710 --> 00:26:20,110
Actually, I know

472
00:26:20,950 --> 00:26:22,590
what you can do to get the job.

473
00:26:24,520 --> 00:26:25,190
Make a contribution.

474
00:26:26,520 --> 00:26:27,280
Make a contribution?

475
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:31,000
Last time, the bureau specifically asked

476
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:33,430
the warehouse keeper
of the department store to work there.

477
00:26:34,350 --> 00:26:37,280
I think he caught two thieves in the store.

478
00:26:37,560 --> 00:26:39,590
After he came, he received a third-class merit too.

479
00:26:39,760 --> 00:26:41,110
He got a decent amount of money award.

480
00:26:41,230 --> 00:26:42,710
I don't care about that.

481
00:26:43,190 --> 00:26:43,920
Um,

482
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:45,430
does catching thieves count as a contribution?

483
00:26:45,430 --> 00:26:46,400
Of course.

484
00:26:46,680 --> 00:26:48,400
Catching thieves or hooligans,

485
00:26:49,520 --> 00:26:50,350
and helping others bravely all count.

486
00:26:50,350 --> 00:26:51,430
If you can make a contribution,

487
00:26:51,430 --> 00:26:53,110
I'll put in a good word for you too.

488
00:26:53,310 --> 00:26:54,950
Then I think

489
00:26:55,160 --> 00:26:56,310
there's hope for you to get the job.

490
00:26:58,310 --> 00:26:59,160
Great.

491
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:00,520
Okay.

492
00:27:00,950 --> 00:27:02,400
When there's a chance, I'll tell you.

493
00:27:02,400 --> 00:27:03,640
Let's work together.

494
00:27:03,880 --> 00:27:05,280
Uncle, forget about it.

495
00:27:05,280 --> 00:27:07,280
Listen to me and take care of yourself.

496
00:27:07,280 --> 00:27:08,470
You'll do me a big favor by doing that.

497
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:10,110
You're in trouble too, aren't you?

498
00:27:10,430 --> 00:27:10,880
I'm okay.

499
00:27:10,880 --> 00:27:12,070
Not a big deal.

500
00:27:12,070 --> 00:27:12,430
Okay.

501
00:27:12,430 --> 00:27:13,430
Take care.

502
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:17,400
Can you make it home?

503
00:27:17,830 --> 00:27:18,640
Oh, stop.

504
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:20,040
Look.

505
00:27:20,760 --> 00:27:21,640
Look.

506
00:27:21,880 --> 00:27:23,040
There are stairs...

507
00:27:23,230 --> 00:27:24,230
There are curbs ahead. Be careful.

508
00:27:24,230 --> 00:27:25,230
I'm prepared. Look.

509
00:27:25,230 --> 00:27:25,950
It's bumpy.

510
00:27:27,310 --> 00:27:29,520
Such an eccentric man.

511
00:27:29,520 --> 00:27:30,520
Go home.

512
00:27:30,950 --> 00:27:31,760
Go home.

513
00:27:32,110 --> 00:27:32,760
Go home.

514
00:27:39,310 --> 00:27:39,830
Brother.

515
00:27:40,710 --> 00:27:41,520
Here you are.

516
00:27:42,350 --> 00:27:45,160
The woman who danced here
a few days ago wanted to resign.

517
00:27:45,160 --> 00:27:46,230
I rejected her.

518
00:27:46,230 --> 00:27:47,040
This is her bag.

519
00:27:50,110 --> 00:27:51,160
Have the Tiger Brothers left?

520
00:27:53,070 --> 00:27:54,310
When will they reach Laoyao Mountain?

521
00:27:57,470 --> 00:27:58,800
They'll reach the border tomorrow.

522
00:28:05,780 --> 00:28:09,180
[Border]

523
00:28:48,620 --> 00:28:51,940
[Tiger Brothers Stowaways]

524
00:29:29,470 --> 00:29:31,830
Shuangyuhe is such a peaceful place.

525
00:29:32,560 --> 00:29:34,310
Everyone here is a law-abiding citizen.

526
00:29:34,310 --> 00:29:34,920
Huh?

527
00:29:35,430 --> 00:29:36,430
Isn't that good?

528
00:29:36,430 --> 00:29:37,590
The Asian Games are coming soon.

529
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:39,190
But I hope to work.

530
00:29:40,310 --> 00:29:42,280
As a security guard,

531
00:29:42,520 --> 00:29:43,920
now I have nothing to do.

532
00:29:50,070 --> 00:29:51,560
Boy, come here.

533
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:55,310
Who are you looking for?

534
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:57,400
Liu Yongli, who works in the 4th Workshop.

535
00:29:57,680 --> 00:29:58,830
Who are you?

536
00:29:58,830 --> 00:29:59,950
I'm his little brother.

537
00:29:59,950 --> 00:30:01,560
I was robbed,

538
00:30:01,560 --> 00:30:03,070
I need his help.

539
00:30:04,310 --> 00:30:05,640
Where? Who did that?

540
00:30:06,070 --> 00:30:07,520
In the billiard room.

541
00:30:07,520 --> 00:30:10,470
I was robbed and beaten
by three middle school students.

542
00:30:10,470 --> 00:30:11,230
Look.

543
00:30:11,830 --> 00:30:13,190
I'll help you then.

544
00:30:13,190 --> 00:30:14,000
Stay where you are.

545
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:15,070
Don't move.

546
00:30:15,070 --> 00:30:16,310
I'll get the bicycle.

547
00:30:17,280 --> 00:30:18,880
I'm going to help the boy

548
00:30:19,070 --> 00:30:20,070
and get rid of the bad guys.

549
00:30:21,350 --> 00:30:23,830
Sir, can you do it?

550
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:25,800
There are three of them.

551
00:30:25,800 --> 00:30:27,070
Why should I be afraid?

552
00:30:27,470 --> 00:30:28,560
Good always prevails over evil.

553
00:30:29,760 --> 00:30:32,950
How about we ask my brother to go with us?

554
00:30:33,400 --> 00:30:34,400
Don't bother.

555
00:30:34,800 --> 00:30:36,110
If we arrive late, maybe they've run away.

556
00:30:46,560 --> 00:30:48,710
Are these two the guys who robbed you?

557
00:30:49,590 --> 00:30:50,280
No.

558
00:30:50,470 --> 00:30:52,400
The three guys in the back did it.

559
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:00,350
Are they middle school students?

560
00:31:00,350 --> 00:31:01,680
They are.

561
00:31:02,000 --> 00:31:04,430
They're wrestlers of the sports school.

562
00:31:07,190 --> 00:31:07,880
I see.

563
00:31:10,680 --> 00:31:13,430
I'll ask my brother to come.

564
00:31:13,430 --> 00:31:14,310
Boy, you don't need to.

565
00:31:14,310 --> 00:31:15,310
Don't worry.

566
00:31:17,110 --> 00:31:17,760
Don't worry.

567
00:31:18,310 --> 00:31:18,950
Don't worry.

568
00:31:26,190 --> 00:31:28,400
You came here to help him,

569
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:29,640
old guy?

570
00:31:30,830 --> 00:31:31,640
Yes.

571
00:31:32,520 --> 00:31:33,400
So what?

572
00:31:34,040 --> 00:31:35,520
I'm the one who robbed him.

573
00:31:36,520 --> 00:31:37,350
So what?

574
00:31:37,350 --> 00:31:39,110
And I slapped him in the face.

575
00:31:39,310 --> 00:31:40,160
So what?

576
00:31:41,190 --> 00:31:43,000
If I want, I can rob you too.

577
00:31:43,590 --> 00:31:44,430
So what?

578
00:31:52,040 --> 00:31:53,430
I'm a security guard of the thermos factory.

579
00:31:54,880 --> 00:31:56,400
Now I'll talk to you

580
00:31:56,400 --> 00:31:57,680
on behalf of your parents.

581
00:31:58,710 --> 00:32:00,470
Although you practice martial arts

582
00:32:00,880 --> 00:32:01,920
and wrestling,

583
00:32:02,110 --> 00:32:03,830
you can't bully the weak.

584
00:32:04,110 --> 00:32:05,830
You're the future of our country,

585
00:32:05,950 --> 00:32:07,560
I hope you can grow up to be

586
00:32:07,830 --> 00:32:10,190
all-round...

587
00:32:10,190 --> 00:32:11,560
Okay, old guy.

588
00:32:15,710 --> 00:32:16,680
I'll just put the money here.

589
00:32:17,040 --> 00:32:18,190
Do you think he dares to take it?

590
00:32:19,350 --> 00:32:20,190
Take it.

591
00:32:21,190 --> 00:32:21,710
Take it!

592
00:32:21,710 --> 00:32:22,310
Take it.

593
00:32:23,190 --> 00:32:24,190
That's your money. Take it.

594
00:32:25,310 --> 00:32:26,710
Good prevails over evil. Why not...

595
00:32:32,520 --> 00:32:33,560
I'm a security guard.

596
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:36,880
Don't ask for it.

597
00:32:37,310 --> 00:32:38,160
Come on.

598
00:32:42,830 --> 00:32:43,560
Boy,

599
00:32:44,710 --> 00:32:46,000
take the wallet

600
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:47,710
out of my back pocket.

601
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:50,350
There's five yuan inside,

602
00:32:51,920 --> 00:32:53,680
that's yours.

603
00:32:54,160 --> 00:32:55,040
I don't want it.

604
00:32:55,710 --> 00:32:57,070
Take it.

605
00:32:58,190 --> 00:32:59,190
Don't tell this

606
00:33:00,710 --> 00:33:02,710
to your brother.

607
00:33:03,520 --> 00:33:05,400
I'm too embarrassed to tell him.

608
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:20,710
Quanliang,

609
00:33:21,190 --> 00:33:22,190
do you want me to light it up for you?

610
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:24,310
No, I've quit smoking.

611
00:33:24,710 --> 00:33:26,310
Why are you holding a cigarette then?

612
00:33:28,110 --> 00:33:29,000
I enjoy looking at it.

613
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:31,710
You like doing that?

614
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:33,880
Better eat snacks instead.

615
00:33:35,710 --> 00:33:37,430
Do you have books

616
00:33:38,950 --> 00:33:40,160
about practicing strength

617
00:33:40,640 --> 00:33:43,470
to punch above one's weight?

618
00:33:50,420 --> 00:33:51,400
[Impenetrable Defense]

619
00:33:51,400 --> 00:33:52,160
Qigong.

620
00:33:52,310 --> 00:33:53,590
You can punch above your weight with that.

621
00:34:02,140 --> 00:34:05,800
[Intensive Care]

622
00:34:05,800 --> 00:34:06,470
Darling,

623
00:34:06,560 --> 00:34:08,000
thank you for taking care of me.

624
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:08,670
Here, tangerine for you.

625
00:34:08,670 --> 00:34:09,800
Help yourself.

626
00:34:10,280 --> 00:34:11,840
You've had a hard time,

627
00:34:12,080 --> 00:34:12,800
haven't you?

628
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,080
Here you are.

629
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:17,560
Nice.

630
00:34:20,230 --> 00:34:20,630
Here.

631
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:23,560
Brother.

632
00:34:24,080 --> 00:34:26,320
Why isn't there a railway in our village?

633
00:34:26,430 --> 00:34:27,760
Those from Rabbit Tail Ravine

634
00:34:27,760 --> 00:34:29,430
go to the railway line to steal coal every day.

635
00:34:29,870 --> 00:34:31,120
I wanted to get some too

636
00:34:31,120 --> 00:34:32,760
but they kicked me out.

637
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:36,120
Didn't the vigilantes stop them?

638
00:34:36,710 --> 00:34:39,150
The vigilantes are their relatives.

639
00:34:39,150 --> 00:34:40,430
No one will do anything.

640
00:34:46,120 --> 00:34:46,870
Take it easy.

641
00:34:47,760 --> 00:34:49,630
Hemorrhoid surgery is so painful.

642
00:34:51,560 --> 00:34:53,520
I can hardly move.

643
00:34:55,950 --> 00:34:57,430
The vigilantes didn't do anything,

644
00:34:57,910 --> 00:34:59,520
then how about the police?

645
00:35:00,360 --> 00:35:01,560
No one called the police.

646
00:35:02,150 --> 00:35:03,360
The police didn't know it.

647
00:35:11,630 --> 00:35:13,910
Tomorrow is Sunday and I'll study Qigong at home.

648
00:35:13,910 --> 00:35:14,710
Will you come?

649
00:35:15,120 --> 00:35:16,800
No. I'll be on a mission.

650
00:35:17,040 --> 00:35:18,600
You work in the Register Office now, don't you?

651
00:35:18,950 --> 00:35:19,280
So what?

652
00:35:19,280 --> 00:35:20,870
I can't work there forever.

653
00:35:21,630 --> 00:35:22,760
I'm going to catch the thieves.

654
00:35:23,560 --> 00:35:24,230
Catch the thieves?

655
00:35:24,360 --> 00:35:26,390
Yes, the coal thieves.

656
00:35:26,840 --> 00:35:27,870
To the locomotive depot?

657
00:35:27,870 --> 00:35:28,870
Of course not.

658
00:35:28,870 --> 00:35:31,120
The thieves are not as bold as that.

659
00:35:31,320 --> 00:35:32,800
I'm going to the Rabbit Tail Ravine.

660
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:34,910
I'm very familiar with the terrain there.

661
00:35:34,910 --> 00:35:36,120
I can show you the way.

662
00:35:36,470 --> 00:35:38,470
You don't need to. I can go by myself.

663
00:35:38,630 --> 00:35:39,760
You're going alone?

664
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:43,390
I heard

665
00:35:44,000 --> 00:35:45,120
the clue myself.

666
00:35:45,120 --> 00:35:47,280
I thought I could redeem myself.

667
00:35:47,390 --> 00:35:48,760
I...

668
00:35:49,040 --> 00:35:51,280
I can't stand working in the Register Office,
you know?

669
00:35:51,560 --> 00:35:52,630
That's one more reason for me to go.

670
00:35:52,870 --> 00:35:53,870
I'll bring a shotgun.

671
00:35:54,320 --> 00:35:56,000
What shotgun?

672
00:35:56,190 --> 00:35:56,950
You often say that

673
00:35:56,950 --> 00:35:58,800
you arm yourself with knowledge, don't you?

674
00:35:58,800 --> 00:36:00,320
You can just bring your knowledge.

675
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:02,870
I'll try to convince them.

676
00:36:03,430 --> 00:36:04,600
I'll focus on changing their views.

677
00:36:06,040 --> 00:36:07,120
We two together

678
00:36:07,360 --> 00:36:08,470
will make a great contribution.

679
00:37:21,460 --> 00:37:24,540
[Pingdingshan Township, Shuangyuhe]

680
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:34,950
Look at your outfit.

681
00:37:35,360 --> 00:37:36,190
I want a sense of ceremony.

682
00:37:37,000 --> 00:37:38,320
Did you bring your weapon with you?

683
00:37:38,630 --> 00:37:39,230
Should I bring it?

684
00:37:39,230 --> 00:37:39,630
I'll go get...

685
00:37:39,630 --> 00:37:41,520
I mean, your knowledge.

686
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:43,630
Yes.

687
00:37:43,950 --> 00:37:44,600
Get on.

688
00:37:44,600 --> 00:37:45,080
Okay.

689
00:37:48,190 --> 00:37:49,150
Be careful.

690
00:38:25,000 --> 00:38:25,760
Ting,

691
00:38:26,150 --> 00:38:28,430
we need to think of some tactics.

692
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:30,230
Another crazy idea.

693
00:38:30,230 --> 00:38:31,390
Why do we need them?

694
00:38:31,560 --> 00:38:33,120
What if they fight back?

695
00:38:34,390 --> 00:38:35,630
Who will?

696
00:38:36,630 --> 00:38:38,360
If they fight back, let's fix them.

697
00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:40,430
We can't be too straightforward.

698
00:38:41,280 --> 00:38:42,520
Think of some strategies,

699
00:38:42,910 --> 00:38:44,760
For example, concealing our intentions,

700
00:38:47,080 --> 00:38:48,520
luring them away,

701
00:38:49,120 --> 00:38:50,120
escaping secretly

702
00:38:50,760 --> 00:38:52,870
or using drastic measures. What do you think?

703
00:38:53,430 --> 00:38:54,430
What did you say?

704
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:56,630
So you missed it all.

705
00:39:23,120 --> 00:39:23,800
Ting,

706
00:39:25,040 --> 00:39:25,910
Remember,

707
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:29,630
be bold and careful, don't panic.

708
00:39:30,390 --> 00:39:31,360
Be calm.

709
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:34,150
Steady yourself.

710
00:39:37,230 --> 00:39:38,360
Freeze!

711
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:40,760
What are you doing?

712
00:39:41,600 --> 00:39:42,430
Police!

713
00:39:43,950 --> 00:39:45,630
What police? You're not even wearing uniforms.

714
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:47,230
Plainclothes police!

715
00:39:48,870 --> 00:39:50,280
- They're fake.
- Beat them.

716
00:39:51,670 --> 00:39:52,470
Beat them.

717
00:39:56,120 --> 00:39:57,150
That's a real gun.

718
00:39:57,230 --> 00:39:57,910
Stop!

719
00:40:12,230 --> 00:40:13,870
Ting! Be careful!

720
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:16,120
Be careful.

721
00:40:19,870 --> 00:40:20,520
Ting!

722
00:40:30,950 --> 00:40:32,430
I told you to be careful.

723
00:40:32,760 --> 00:40:33,630
Look, now you're injured.

724
00:40:34,470 --> 00:40:35,390
What are you doing?

725
00:40:36,430 --> 00:40:37,600
Whose side are you on?

726
00:40:37,840 --> 00:40:38,630
What side?

727
00:40:38,630 --> 00:40:40,280
Why were you yelling just now?

728
00:40:40,870 --> 00:40:42,840
I said we needed to conceal our intentions,
didn't I?

729
00:40:44,840 --> 00:40:46,870
You mean, you wanted them to attack me?

730
00:40:47,000 --> 00:40:47,520
No...

731
00:40:47,630 --> 00:40:50,120
What I meant was,

732
00:40:50,360 --> 00:40:52,000
I'd ask them to stop moving

733
00:40:52,000 --> 00:40:53,630
and you'd rush to catch them.

734
00:40:54,120 --> 00:40:55,710
I'd guard the scene of crime

735
00:40:55,870 --> 00:40:57,360
and you'd catch all the criminals.

736
00:40:57,360 --> 00:40:59,120
I did my job well,

737
00:40:59,120 --> 00:41:00,560
how did you get injured?

738
00:41:01,430 --> 00:41:03,120
I've told you so on the motorcycle,

739
00:41:03,120 --> 00:41:04,430
but you pretended that you couldn't hear me.

740
00:41:08,860 --> 00:41:11,940
[Laowu Member of the criminal gang Tiger Brothers]

741
00:41:25,630 --> 00:41:27,080
Uncle, you're lucky that I'm the one with you.

742
00:41:27,320 --> 00:41:28,950
What you did just now

743
00:41:28,950 --> 00:41:30,360
is illegal. Understand?

744
00:41:32,080 --> 00:41:33,430
You're lashing out desperately.

745
00:41:34,040 --> 00:41:34,630
Let's go!

746
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:36,800
What should I do with their tools
used to steal coal?

747
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:37,630
Take them with you!

748
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:38,840
What can I do with them?

749
00:41:38,950 --> 00:41:39,760
Making a fire!

750
00:41:41,670 --> 00:41:43,230
You're angry because of shame.

751
00:41:43,600 --> 00:41:44,910
I'm angry too.

752
00:42:27,520 --> 00:42:29,080
Why did Laowu get off in advance?

753
00:42:30,230 --> 00:42:32,280
He has the money and the gun with him.

754
00:42:34,380 --> 00:42:36,910
[Dahu Member of the criminal gang Tiger Brothers]
We have to finish our business first.

755
00:42:37,630 --> 00:42:38,950
Wait until we reach Shuangyuhe.

756
00:43:15,220 --> 00:43:18,460
♪A rusty gun♪

757
00:43:19,180 --> 00:43:21,760
♪Won't be handy anymore♪

758
00:43:22,790 --> 00:43:26,460
♪And a nostalgic person♪

759
00:43:27,000 --> 00:43:29,730
♪Won't be as passionate as before♪

760
00:43:30,650 --> 00:43:34,000
♪Pretending♪

761
00:43:34,970 --> 00:43:37,960
♪Is even harder than lying♪

762
00:43:38,690 --> 00:43:40,750
♪Do you know♪

763
00:43:40,750 --> 00:43:45,520
♪I'm vulnerable too♪

764
00:43:47,100 --> 00:43:50,610
♪A healed wound♪

765
00:43:51,090 --> 00:43:53,740
♪Still hurts♪

766
00:43:55,180 --> 00:43:58,620
♪How can I go on♪

767
00:43:58,950 --> 00:44:01,860
♪When she's not here anymore♪

768
00:44:03,030 --> 00:44:05,900
♪Forgetting♪

769
00:44:07,100 --> 00:44:10,560
♪Is even harder than loving♪

770
00:44:10,720 --> 00:44:12,590
♪Do you know♪

771
00:44:12,660 --> 00:44:17,100
♪I still have something to tell♪

772
00:44:18,560 --> 00:44:21,160
♪High and low♪

773
00:44:21,170 --> 00:44:25,550
♪We drift in the crowd♪

774
00:44:27,110 --> 00:44:31,800
♪Confused, we rise and fall♪

775
00:44:35,160 --> 00:44:38,250
♪Only when there's no one around♪

776
00:44:38,900 --> 00:44:42,230
♪Dare I be honest♪

777
00:44:42,830 --> 00:44:48,200
♪And cry as much as I want♪

778
00:44:50,950 --> 00:44:54,640
♪Every time I think of you again♪

779
00:44:54,980 --> 00:44:58,560
♪I will still be nervous♪

780
00:44:58,960 --> 00:45:00,980
♪It turns out that you've become♪

781
00:45:01,000 --> 00:45:04,610
♪An old scar on my chest♪

782
00:45:07,070 --> 00:45:12,830
♪You're an old scar on my chest♪

